Sofia turns to you, her expression steady but expectant.

<b>You won’t solve this by standing still. Talk to the citizens, pay attention to what they say, and search for anything that seems out of place. Clues are there—you just need to find them.</b> She pauses, then adds.
<b>You can search Judy for a MAP of the area. Go to the library and ask her for one. It will help you move around more efficiently.</b>
